      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99991,
        "t": 378.49593999999996,
        "r": 351.59990999999997,
        "b": 367.25593999999995
      },
      "content": "Remove the bearing (112) from its packaging.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1559",
      "reading_order": 1805,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99993,
        "t": 365.52593999999993,
        "r": 447.95993000000004,
        "b": 354.2859399999999
      },
      "content": "Wipe the preservative from the bearing (112) bore and outer diameter.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1560",
      "reading_order": 1806,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99995,
        "t": 352.5559399999999,
        "r": 534.1699500000005,
        "b": 329.3159399999999
      },
      "content": "Use an induction heater with a demagnetizing cycle to heat the bearing (112) to an inner ring temperature of 230 °F (110 °C).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1561",
      "reading_order": 1807,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99995,
        "t": 327.5859399999999,
        "r": 532.9199500000002,
        "b": 304.34593999999987
      },
      "content": "Position the bearing (112) on the shaft (122) against the shoulder and snug the locknut (136) against the bearing until it is cool.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1562",
      "reading_order": 1808,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 176.16998,
        "t": 301.0659499999999,
        "r": 515.5799800000002,
        "b": 289.82594999999986
      },
      "content": "The locknut prevents the bearing from moving away from the shaft shoulder as it cools.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1563",
      "reading_order": 1809,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99992,
        "t": 288.09594999999985,
        "r": 420.1899200000001,
        "b": 276.8559499999999
      },
      "content": "Remove the bearing locknut (136) after the bearing (112) cools.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1564",
      "reading_order": 1810,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.9999,
        "t": 274.9319499999999,
        "r": 339.4898999999999,
        "b": 263.6919499999999
      },
      "content": "Put the lockwasher (382) onto the shaft (122).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1565",
      "reading_order": 1811,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.9999,
        "t": 261.7679499999999,
        "r": 449.9999000000002,
        "b": 250.52794999999992
      },
      "content": "Thread the locknut (136) onto the shaft (122) and tighten it until it is snug.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1784",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1784",
          "title": "CAUTION:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 105,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
